      "message": "feat: rank models and days by effective tokens including cache\n\nIntroduce tokens_effective_total = tokens_total + cache_read + cache_write\nas the unified ranking metric for /api/models and the daily chart, so\nhigh-cache models surface consistently in both views. Adds a shared\ndashboard.token_metrics helper used by app.py, dashboard/daily.py,\ndashboard/simulation.py, and dashboard/sources.py (Codex, Hermes\nadapters). AGENTS.md now notes the uv miniconda PATH fallback.",
